<title>FRANCE: Air France picks Ammirati Puris Lintas for ads.</title>
<headline>Air France picks Ammirati Puris Lintas for ads.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state airline Air France said on Tuesday that it had awarded its world advertising business to Ammirati Puris Lintas.</p>
<p>It said in a brief statement the decision was taken after a public tender launched in February.</p>
<p>It also said the purchasing of advertising space had been awarded to Mediapolis, a subsidiary of Havas Advertising.</p>
</text>
